  (text_box "- The array LEDs have no visible reference designators: LED101-106 (FX) and\n  LED111-116 (POW) are numbering for this schematic.\n- Active-low drive from U4 and the RJ-resistor pairing are inferred. Row 6 is\n  assumed to be the SFP (U4 P9LED0, pin 67).\n- The POW LEDs are probably driven by the PoE module (not traced)." (at 12.7 139.7 0) (size 109.22 25.4) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 120 120 120 1)) (fill (type color) (color 255 255 225 1)) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid e997b5dd-dba4-45a1-ac7b-e00b11fbbaca))
